{%- comment -%}
PFC Focuses: mirrors the "Focuses" band of the web home page (focus_payload in
automations/scripts/trmnl_home.py). Three tiers: Foundations, Active Pursuits,
Currently Consuming. Each row carries its light as a word (RED / YELLOW / GREEN /
NO DATA) or PARKED, plus "N of M" progress on its primary measure. `repick` is
the re-pick nudge line, empty when there is none.

E-ink rules: no emoji, no inline styles, framework classes only.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% template focus_row %}
<div class="item">
  <div class="meta"></div>
  <div class="content">
    <span class="{{ title_class }}" data-clamp="1">{{ row.title }}</span>
    <span class="{{ label_class }}">{{ row.status }}{% if row.progress != "" %} - {{ row.progress }}{% endif %}</span>
  </div>
</div>
{% endtemplate %}
